    <div class="max-w-none px-9 lg:pl-[110px] lg:pr-[180px] grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-[max-content_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-[calc(clamp(24px,4vw,64px)_+_15px)] items-start">
      <h2 class="text-[28px] font-bold leading-[40px] text-[#333333] mb-8 font-barlow-condensed text-left">Description</h2>
      <!-- Right column: description copy + the 6 feature cards (grid cell 2) -->
      <div class="min-w-0">
      <div class="max-w-none mb-10 space-y-4 text-[#626469] text-[14px] leading-relaxed">
        <p>CHITEK Ultra-slim Active Harmonic Filter AHF is an advanced and comprehensive power quality solution for power grids, which adopts an advanced three-level inverter topology to deliver fast and efficient real time harmonic mitigation. This CHITEK Ultra-slim active harmonic filter also provides selectable priority functions for reactive power compensation, load balancing and harmonic filtering.</p>
        <p>Connected in parallel with the power system, the CHITEK Ultra-slim AHF collects real time grid data via externally installed sampling current transformers (CT). Its built in DSP leverages a high speed intelligent FFT algorithm to compute the required compensation current and issue control commands to the power modules. The filter dynamically tunes the switching frequency for optimized performance, enabling the AHF to generate reverse phase equal magnitude compensation current to counteract harmonic currents. This suppresses harmonic distortion across each harmonic order and achieves total harmonic distortion (THD) below 5%, in compliance with the IEEE 519,IEEE 6100-36 standard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
